     A                                      COLHDG('CCYYMMDD FORMAT')
     A            FRJRST         2A         TEXT('Jurisdiction State')
     A            FRCTG1        10A         TEXT('Location Number')
     A*
     A* Fields not required but can be loaded from FROI
     A*
     A            FRMID          1A         TEXT('Employee MI')
